  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 옴의 법칙 V = IR이죠?<br>이거에 대해서 <br>1. 전압이 일정할 때, 저항과 전류 사이 관계<br>2. 저항이 일정할 때, 전압과 전류 사이 관계<br>두 가지 실험을 말씀드리려 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0dcc10ba4c8c9663002d23caa28d22d08e23746f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0dcc10ba4c8c9663002d23caa28d22d08e23746f\" data-origin-width=\"1027\" data-origin-height=\"1475\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b4bcc44578bb99b63461c82c7499230fc05baad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b4bcc44578bb99b63461c82c7499230fc05baad\" data-origin-width=\"1025\" data-origin-height=\"1475\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">요로코롬 저항 바꾸기!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a1792b2d7b1a354a66da85c7cb1bfc04a3703bc1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a1792b2d7b1a354a66da85c7cb1bfc04a3703bc1\" data-origin-width=\"1027\" data-origin-height=\"1478\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/432b87557914572df33289a27c374c4e329176ba\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/432b87557914572df33289a27c374c4e329176ba\" data-origin-width=\"1013\" data-origin-height=\"874\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">잘 나올겁니다! 직접 해보세요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecaae8e8f35dbc200b537464c450f7b61c432752\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecaae8e8f35dbc200b537464c450f7b61c432752\" data-origin-width=\"1016\" data-origin-height=\"1459\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1d57faba8f72715cae1649a4e2bba65548d3840\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1d57faba8f72715cae1649a4e2bba65548d3840\" data-origin-width=\"1020\" data-origin-height=\"1479\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래에 설명이 나오는데,<br>두 개 이상의 센서를 활용하면<br>두 센서 값의 상관 관계를 볼 수 있도록<br>설정할 수 있습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40ad2b328c742456d1c9c2da5d0cbbb7fcbbaeeb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40ad2b328c742456d1c9c2da5d0cbbb7fcbbaeeb\" data-origin-width=\"1020\" data-origin-height=\"1457\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1679dbc6362207643c1defda423c69777e9d36f7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1679dbc6362207643c1defda423c69777e9d36f7\" data-origin-width=\"1025\" data-origin-height=\"821\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">위와 같은 그래프를 이지온에서 보면</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2fc5b0f09b941d3921e340dffc302b7326f330ca\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2fc5b0f09b941d3921e340dffc302b7326f330ca\" data-origin-width=\"2340\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">진짜 이렇게(x축은 전압, y축은 전류) 이렇게 잘나옵니다. 전원공급장치에서 전압을 높히면서 전류값을 하나하나 기록할 필요 없이<br>천천히 전압을 올리기만 하면<br>자동으로 센서에서 전압과 전류의 관계를 알려줍니다.<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bHEHY3/dJMb8YpTTRA/hU5vz6DPRSliKVqaJmVrLk/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bHEHY3/dJMb8YpTTRA/hU5vz6DPRSliKVqaJmVrLk/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
